OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen 276 girls were seized in
OL,7,     FChibok, north-east Nigeria, Aisha
OL,8,     FYesufu felt it personally. She
OL,9,     Fcame from the same impoverished
OL,10,     Fbackground and knew she had to
OL,11,     Fgive them a voice.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2012, rock art found on the
OL,14,     FIndonesian island of Sulawesi
OL,15,     Fchallenged our understanding of
OL,16,     Fearly human history.
